'''Candlers''' are an enemy added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''. They fly around the room, bouncing off walls, and spawn flames beneath them.

Sometimes, they can spawn alongside {{E|The Haunt}}.

== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}}The [[Anti:Candler|Candler]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* Candlers resemble {{E|Lil' Haunt}}s with the face of The Haunt when it is in its second phase.

